      "message": "lgtm, but looping in Greg to double check this behavior is acceptable. \n\nOriginally, this sort of issue was meant to be a failed Recorder::snap() or a failed insert so it bubbled up to the client. Failing at the DrawPass level is the most convenient way to do this, but I wonder if we need to mark something on the Recorder to know to fail as well?\n\nShort term for avoiding the crashes in canary, I\u0027m still fine with this as-is regardless of what we decide for long-term behavioral goals.",
